@startuml
binary "Binary Serial Data" as D
robust "Robust" as R
concise "Concise" as C

@-5
D is low: idle1
R is lo: idle2
C is 1:idle3
@-1
D is high: start1
R is hi: start2
C is 0:start3

@0
D is low: 1 lsb1
R is lo: 1 lsb2
C is 1:lsb3

@1
D is high: 0
R is hi: 0
C is 0

@6
D is low: 1
R is lo: 1
C is 1

@7
D is high: 0 msb
R is hi: 0 msb
C is 0: msb

@8
D is low: stop
R is lo: stop
C is 1: stop

@0 <-> @8 : Serial data bits for ASCII "A" (Little Endian)

@enduml